<div id="u-credit-00496-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-yuanye" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6981100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014076" alt="Dr YuanYe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6981100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-yuanye" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981100); return false;">Dr YuanYe</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1608958740 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Dec 2020 04:59</span></p>
